hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"256","Abdah bin Abdullah Al-Khuza’i told us, Muhammad bin Bishr told us, Zakaria bin Abi Zaida told us, on the authority of Mus’ab bin Shaybah, On the authority of Talq ibn Habib, on the authority of Abdullah ibn al-Zubayr, on the authority of Aisha, may God be pleased with her, that she told him that the Prophet, may God’s prayers and peace be upon him, He said: “He should be washed four times: from ritual impurity, on Friday, washing the dead, and cupping.”"
